WEBVTT

00:00:13.014 --> 00:00:14.276
[EXPLODES]
[GASPS]

00:00:16.191 --> 00:00:17.540
[ALL GASP]
[SANDY SOBS]

00:00:19.847 --> 00:00:20.979
Cave!

00:00:21.022 --> 00:00:22.110
Everyone inside.

00:00:22.154 --> 00:00:23.416
Hurry up.
Let's go.

00:00:23.459 --> 00:00:24.678
Let's go. Go!

00:00:26.941 --> 00:00:28.029
No!

00:00:30.814 --> 00:00:32.338
No more caves,
Grug.

00:00:32.381 --> 00:00:34.166
What?

00:00:34.209 --> 00:00:37.343
We're going to jump
on the sun and ride it
to Tomorrow with Guy!

00:00:37.386 --> 00:00:39.736
Wait. So you're all
going to do this?

00:00:41.434 --> 00:00:42.522
Thunk?

00:00:44.045 --> 00:00:45.525
Sorry, Dad.

00:00:47.266 --> 00:00:49.790
You have to stop
worrying for all of us.

00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:52.662
It's my job to worry!
It's my job to
follow the rules!

00:00:52.706 --> 00:00:54.664
The rules don't
work out here!

00:00:54.708 --> 00:00:56.014
They kept us alive!

00:00:56.057 --> 00:01:00.192
That wasn't living!
That was just not dying.

00:01:00.235 --> 00:01:01.715
There's a difference.

00:01:01.758 --> 00:01:04.413
Ugga, everyone,
you have to listen to me.

00:01:04.457 --> 00:01:07.547
We would be dead
if we listened to you!

00:01:09.114 --> 00:01:11.072
We have to follow Guy now.

00:01:12.508 --> 00:01:13.509
[GASPS]

00:01:15.555 --> 00:01:16.556
Guy.

00:01:17.252 --> 00:01:18.862
Guy? Run.

00:01:18.906 --> 00:01:20.212
[GRUNTS]
[GASPS]

00:01:24.433 --> 00:01:25.434
[SCREAMS]

00:01:28.524 --> 00:01:29.960
GUY: This is pointless!

00:01:30.004 --> 00:01:31.745
We're running out of time.
Everything is collapsing.

00:01:31.788 --> 00:01:34.008
You're being irrational
and counterproductive!

00:01:34.052 --> 00:01:35.314
Big words anger me!

00:01:35.923 --> 00:01:37.185
Keep talking.

00:01:37.229 --> 00:01:38.447
Countermeasures!

00:01:39.448 --> 00:01:40.928
Ah!

00:01:40.971 --> 00:01:42.364
You remember how
you were this morning?
You changed.

00:01:42.408 --> 00:01:44.105
Idea man.
Modern man.

00:01:44.888 --> 00:01:48.022
I am a caveman!

00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:49.241
No, no, no, wait!

00:01:49.284 --> 00:01:50.590
Ahhh!
[GROANING]

00:01:52.548 --> 00:01:53.636
[BOTH GRUNT]

00:01:54.115 --> 00:01:55.508
[PANTING]

00:01:55.551 --> 00:01:56.596
[BOTH GASP]

00:01:58.076 --> 00:02:00.121
[BOTH SCREAMING]

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:09.739
[STRAINING]

00:02:10.566 --> 00:02:12.002
No!

00:02:12.046 --> 00:02:14.744
What is this stuff
that saves you
from my punches?

00:02:16.006 --> 00:02:17.138
Tar.

00:02:17.182 --> 00:02:19.532
No. I have to get
back to them.

00:02:20.141 --> 00:02:21.316
Stop struggling.

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:22.491
No!

00:02:22.535 --> 00:02:23.579
Grug, stop!

00:02:28.323 --> 00:02:29.629
[SIGHS]
[WHIMPERS]

00:02:30.499 --> 00:02:32.893
No one gets out of this.

00:02:33.981 --> 00:02:36.026
Believe me...

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:37.506
I know.

00:02:38.768 --> 00:02:39.900
Your--

00:02:39.943 --> 00:02:42.598
Family. Yeah.

00:02:48.691 --> 00:02:50.302
Sorry.

00:02:51.216 --> 00:02:52.347
[SIGHS]

00:02:53.566 --> 00:02:57.047
I was little
when it happened.

00:02:57.091 --> 00:02:59.659
Last thing my parents
told me was...

00:02:59.702 --> 00:03:01.051
"Don't hide.

00:03:01.965 --> 00:03:03.402
"Live.

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:07.710
"Follow the sun.

00:03:07.754 --> 00:03:09.886
"You'll make it
to Tomorrow."

00:03:12.237 --> 00:03:15.022
You followed the light.

00:03:15.065 --> 00:03:17.198
My daughter
is a lot like you.

00:03:17.242 --> 00:03:18.330
No.

00:03:18.373 --> 00:03:20.070
She's like you.

00:03:20.114 --> 00:03:23.204
She loves you,
but always forgets
to say it.

00:03:23.248 --> 00:03:25.859
Just like you
forget to tell her.

00:03:26.729 --> 00:03:28.862
[SIGHS]

00:03:28.905 --> 00:03:34.346
I guess I was just busy
keeping them all alive.

00:03:34.389 --> 00:03:37.914
It's okay.
That's what dads do.

00:03:44.573 --> 00:03:47.533
That's right.

00:03:47.576 --> 00:03:49.926
But we can't do
that from here.

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:52.668
We need one of your ideas.

00:03:55.454 --> 00:03:58.283
Come on.
You can do it.

00:03:59.936 --> 00:04:02.591
[ANIMAL GROWLS]
[WHIMPERS]

00:04:02.635 --> 00:04:05.681
Belt! Emergency Idea
Generator, activate!

00:04:06.073 --> 00:04:07.205
Ow!

00:04:07.857 --> 00:04:09.424
Ooh! I've got it.

00:04:13.123 --> 00:04:14.299
Ta-da!

00:04:15.517 --> 00:04:16.997
Wow.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:19.739
Yeah, I know.
But he's doing the best
with what he has.

00:04:19.782 --> 00:04:20.957
Let's go.

00:04:26.311 --> 00:04:28.182
There he is.

00:04:28.226 --> 00:04:31.054
Belt, I want romance,
drama, sincerity.

00:04:31.098 --> 00:04:32.099
Move me.

00:04:33.274 --> 00:04:34.580
[PLAYING UPBEAT MUSIC]

00:04:38.236 --> 00:04:39.672
GUY: Okay, he sees us.

00:04:39.715 --> 00:04:42.109
That's our cue.
Now, work it!

00:04:42.152 --> 00:04:43.371
[GUY IMITATING FEMALE TIGER]

00:04:51.336 --> 00:04:52.728
GUY: He's
not coming over.

00:04:52.772 --> 00:04:54.513
I don't think our puppet
looks scared enough.

00:04:54.556 --> 00:04:56.993
Scared?
I'll show you scared.

00:04:57.037 --> 00:04:59.169
Hand me those
acting sticks!

00:04:59.213 --> 00:05:00.301
[GRUG SHRIEKING]

00:05:01.781 --> 00:05:03.173
[GROANING]

00:05:05.915 --> 00:05:07.526
[CONTINUES SHRIEKING]

00:05:09.658 --> 00:05:10.659
[CHUCKLES]

00:05:15.098 --> 00:05:16.752
[STRAINING]
Hold on!

00:05:18.493 --> 00:05:19.712
[GRUNTS]

00:05:20.365 --> 00:05:21.409
[PURRS]

00:05:22.671 --> 00:05:23.890
[GASPS]

00:05:24.934 --> 00:05:26.196
[BOTH GASP]

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:27.502
Dun-dun-dun!

00:05:31.332 --> 00:05:32.290
[SNARLS]

00:05:36.206 --> 00:05:37.512
[YELPS]

00:05:39.035 --> 00:05:40.341
[WHIMPERS]

00:05:44.867 --> 00:05:46.434
[BLOWS WHISTLE]

00:05:46.478 --> 00:05:48.480
Yes! You did it.
[GRUNTS]

00:05:49.524 --> 00:05:50.656
UGGA: Grug!
THUNK: Dad!

00:05:50.699 --> 00:05:52.962
Hey! We're okay!

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:56.749
Yeah.
[GRUNTS]

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.621
We're okay.

00:05:59.665 --> 00:06:01.014
[RUMBLING]

00:06:01.057 --> 00:06:02.232
[ALL SCREAM]

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:06.541
[BOTH GASP]

00:06:11.154 --> 00:06:13.809
Grug, your call.

00:06:14.984 --> 00:06:16.899
Take us to Tomorrow.

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:24.385
Hurry!

00:06:24.429 --> 00:06:26.692
Come on! We're
going to make it!

00:06:26.735 --> 00:06:28.302
[ALL PANTING]

00:06:28.346 --> 00:06:29.999
You were right.

00:06:30.043 --> 00:06:32.567
There it is!
The sun!

00:06:32.611 --> 00:06:35.831
We can do it!
We can ride it
to Tomorrow!

00:06:39.922 --> 00:06:41.402
[ALL GASP]
[RUMBLING]

